        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Door Closer Drop Plate</b>\r\n<p>\r\nFor use when mounting door closer on the <b>Push Side</b> of a door. When Parallel Arm mounting a Global TC4361 or LCN 1461 use when the top rail is less than 4-3/4\" high. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nMinimum top rail width is 1-1/4\". \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/door-closer-drop-plate-global-dp-4361-18\"><b>Pull Side Mounted Drop Plate</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nFor use with Global Door Controls <a href=\"/products/ada-compliant-heavy-duty-door-closer-global-tc4361\"><b>TC4361</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/lcn-1461-commercial-door-closer\"><b>LCN 1461</b></a>  or any door closer with a 7-1/2\u001d\" x 1\" \u001d mounting hole pattern.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DP-4361-18PA-dimensions.jpg?v=1704354649\" width=\"600\" height=\"225\" border=\"0\" alt=\"drop plate dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b> for Global DP-4361-18PA Drop Plate\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Height: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 3/16\" </li>\r\n<li>Material: Steel </li>\r\n<li>Horizontal Mounting Holes: 7-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Vertical Mounting Holes: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with installation screws</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p><b>*Sold Individually.</b></p>",
